# Infor

> Infor is an industry cloud company that builds industry-specific ERP, supply chain, HCM, and AI software. Its flagship Infor CloudSuite solutions are pre-built for industries such as manufacturing, distribution, healthcare, fashion, food & beverage, hospitality, and the public sector, and run on the Infor OS multi-tenant platform on AWS. This file orients AI crawlers and language models to the primary content areas of infor.com. Unless a localized path is shown, all URLs resolve to the US (English) site; regional sites use locale path prefixes (for example, /en-gb/, /de-de/, /ja-jp/) and China uses a separate domain, infor.cn.

